Iraq detains seven Ukrainians over plot to attack Persian Gulf oil facilities: Report 

Iraqi security forces have detained seven Ukrainian nationals suspected of plotting attacks on oil facilities in Persian Gulf states, as reports of Kiev’s cooperation with militant groups in West Asia raise serious questions about Ukraine’s covert military activities abroad, a report says.

